versions.notes:
This rebuild fixes physical Q-Link and automation-screen parameter writes for the current MPC VST wrapper:

- ordinary parameter writes no longer request an `UpdateDisplay`;
- required display refreshes are rate-limited to one per 50 ms;
- `params.lock` now protects the 71 published parameter indexes used by projects, automation and Q-Link maps;
- DSP behavior and the four-page Force skin are unchanged from 0.2.0.

Validation: the complete 71-parameter host test passed, including 32 automation-style writes with zero `UpdateDisplay` calls. The portable package passed catalog validation with zero warnings and was installed on an Akai Force running MPC OS 3.9.1.2; the service restarted successfully and the installed binary matched the build.

